Package: piiscan
Title: Find Personal Data in Research Files
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Gaurav", "Sood", , "gsood07@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Scans survey exports, statistical data files, spreadsheets
    and text documents for likely personal data such as names, phone
    numbers, email addresses, dates of birth and locations. Every file is
    first read with an established reader and accounted for as read,
    unsupported or failed. Findings report where the data are and the
    evidence: what a field is called, what it contains, or how it behaves.
    The package reports; it does not anonymize.
